-- The TripSit interaction matrix: 421 pairs.
--
-- PROVENANCE. Every row is TripSit's work — both the rating and, where present,
-- the explanatory note. Imported from
-- https://github.com/TripSit/drugs (combos.json), which is the machine-readable
-- source behind https://combo.tripsit.me/ and the poster most people have seen.
-- `source` and `source_url` are on every row and the UI credits them on every
-- surface that renders one.
--
-- WHY NOT THE POSTER. The obvious way to build this is to read the PNG. That was
-- rejected: 300+ cells transcribed by eye, on a page where a wrong cell is a
-- person taking a combination we told them was fine. The repo is also current
-- where the poster is not — v4.0 of the image is from 2019 and charts 25
-- substances; combos.json charts 31, adding AMT, PCP, lithium, pregabalin,
-- diphenhydramine and mephedrone.
--
-- SYMMETRY WAS VERIFIED, NOT ASSUMED. The upstream file stores both directions.
-- Before collapsing to one row per pair, all 841 directed entries were compared:
-- 421 unordered pairs, ZERO status disagreements, one pair present in a single
-- direction only (amphetamines->lithium). Where only one direction carried a
-- note, that note is kept.
--
-- MAPPING. Upstream keys are their vocabulary, ours are slugs; `source_pair`
-- records the original so a re-import can be diffed. Two are worth naming:
-- `mushrooms` -> `psilocybin` (we file the compound, not the fungus) and `dox`
-- -> `dom-doi-dob-doc`. `2c-x` maps to `2c-b`, which already answers to "2C-x"
-- as an alias — the upstream row is for the family and 2C-B is its archetype.
--
-- REFRESHING. Re-run the generator against combos.json and replace this file
-- wholesale; the insert is idempotent on (tag_a_id, tag_b_id). When you do,
-- re-read the substance descriptions too — 20260909171500 documents two that
-- contradicted this data and had to be corrected before launch.

insert into public.substance_interactions (tag_a_id, tag_b_id, status, note, source, source_url, source_pair)
select least(ta.id, tb.id), greatest(ta.id, tb.id), v.status, nullif(v.note,''),
       'tripsit', 'https://combo.tripsit.me/', v.pair
from (values
  ('2c-t-x','2c-b','caution','','2c-t-x|2c-x'),
  ('2c-t-x','5-meo-xxt','caution','Both classes of compounds can be unpredictable alone','2c-t-x|5-meo-xxt'),
  ('2c-t-x','alcohol','low_risk_decrease','Both these classes of compound can interact unpredictably. Caution should be exercised.','2c-t-x|alcohol'),
  ('2c-t-x','amphetamine','unsafe','Stimulants increase anxiety levels and the risk of thought loops which can lead to negative experiences. In extreme cases, they can result in severe vasoconstriction, tachycardia, hypertension, and heart failure.','2c-t-x|amphetamines'),
