  ('dom-doi-dob-doc','pcp','unsafe','Details of this combination are not well understood but PCP generally interacts in an unpredictable manner.','dox|pcp'),
  ('dom-doi-dob-doc','pregabalin','caution','Caution should be given due to DOx drugs stimulating effects and pregabalin’s seizure concerns at higher dosages. Pregabalin may reduce the vasoconstriction, anxiety, and other side effects of DOx drugs. Additionally, Pregabalin may increase DOx drugs inhibition and risk of injury.','dox|pregabalin'),
