  ('ghb','ketamine','dangerous','Both substances cause ataxia and bring a risk of vomiting and unconsciousness. If the user falls unconscious while under the influence there is a severe risk of vomit aspiration if they are not placed in the recovery position.','ghb/gbl|ketamine'),
  ('ghb','lsd','low_risk_decrease','','ghb/gbl|lsd'),
  ('ghb','maois','low_risk_synergy','','ghb/gbl|maois'),
  ('ghb','mdma','caution','Large amounts of GHB/GBL may overwhelm the effects of MDMA on the comedown.','ghb/gbl|mdma'),
  ('ghb','mephedrone','caution','Both can dull each other''s effects, so if one wears off before the other it''s possible to overdose due to the lack of counteraction. Both substances affect the heart and may lead to further dangerous heart complications at higher dosages. Additionally, the combination may increase the negative side effects of each other.','ghb/gbl|mephedrone'),
